excessive rises in the yen," the report said.   \par \par \uc2 "But the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was their first aimed at actually pushing the yen lower," the report added.   \par \par \uc2 Japan has vigorously defended the dollar from falling much below 106 yen during recent sessions.   \par \par \uc2 According to some technical strategists, a decisive dollar fall below 106 yen could trigger a much steeper decline down to around 101 yen; a scenario which Japan is seeking to avoid in order to protect the competitiveness of its exporters.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040109e019003bw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
