apan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around 106 yen in U.S. trade on Wednesday to prop up the dollar. But many doubted for how long Japan would be able to deflect upward pressure on the yen from the dollar's broad-based decline.  \par \par \uc2 Persistent concerns over the health of the U.S. balance of payments have taken a heavy toll on the dollar, which fell around 10 percent against the yen last year.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040108e018001qf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
