\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Options - Implied vols signal limited dlr/yen downside.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Kyle Peterson  \par \uc2 531 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2004\par 20:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 CHICAGO, Jan 6 (Reuters) - While \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analysts are debating whether the dollar might break through the 106 yen level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  options market is suggesting that the greenback will avoid taking the plunge for the next few weeks.  \par \par \uc2 Implied volatility for dollar/yen options with one-month expirations was near 9.1 percent on Tuesday. For one-week expiration, volatility was near 8.6 percent.  \par \par \uc2 Implied volatility is a statistical measure of how much the options market expects the price of the underlying \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to move during the life of the option. Volatility is a key component in pricing options.  \par \par \uc2 "If we were going to break (below 106) on dollar/yen, I would expect one-week (volatility) to be a lot higher than it really is," said Simon Smollet, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  options analyst at IDEAglobal in London.  \par \par \uc2 Volatility for one-month dollar/yen options has lingered between 9.5 percent and 7.7 percent since early December as the dollar extended a slow downtrend that took the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a three-year low of 106.01 yen on Monday. The 7.7 percent reading hit on Dec. 19, was the lowest implied volatility reported since early September.  \par \par \uc2 The greenback lingered in a narrow range on Tuesday, trading as low as 106.03.  \par \par \uc2 Some analysts think the dollar's ricochet off the 106 level was the work of Japanese monetary authorities, who spent a record 20 trillion yen last year in yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the yen's export-damaging gains against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 In fact, traders suspected the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on Tuesday, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not confirmed any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The dollar Lost more than 9 percent of its value against the yen in 2003.  \par \par \uc2 The 106 level has come into greater focus after a Nikkei news service report said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary authorities had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a second consecutive day on Tuesday. The report said Japan bought dollars for yen, believing that a breach of 106 yen would send the dollar into a free fall.  \par \par \uc2 Now, the relatively low options volatility suggests the potential for further dramatic declines appears to have abated.  \par \par \uc2 "I don't think you could sneak such a move by the options market and not get them to notice," Smollett said.  \par \par \uc2 Others in the market, however, noted that with the dollar trading so close to 106, the dollar still could slip past that level even in a low implied volatility environment  \par \par \uc2 "The options market isn't always right," said one New York-based options dealer who asked not to be named. "That being said, I think people are pretty confident that the BOJ is going to be there for a while."  \par \par \uc2 Also on Tuesday the one-month risk reversal for dollar/yen options was near at 0.1 percent, favoring the dollar downside.  \par \par \uc2 Risk reversals can be used to measure the market's appetite for puts against calls. Puts give the holder the right, but not the obligation, to sell the underlying \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it reaches a predetermined strike price, while calls give the holder the right to sell.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040106e0160049o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
