\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  remains ready for  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2 -Mizoguchi.  \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2004\par 02:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Jan 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, said on Monday that Japanese authorities remain ready to step into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if there is a danger of volatility.   \par \par \uc2  "We will take appropriate measures when necessary, there is no change in our position," Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters as he arrived for work.   \par \par \uc2  "We are watching to make sure there is no overshooting in the market."   \par \par \uc2  He declined comment on whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the past week.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a record 20 trillion yen ($186.9 billion) in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in 2003 as it sought to curb the yen's strength against the dollar and protect Japanese exporters, who are leading the nation's recovery.   \par \par \uc2  Last month the government took steps to ensure it has enough cash for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , raising the limit on the amount it can borrow for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and making an arrangement with the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell foreign bonds to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to raise cash.   \par \par \uc2  Mizoguchi reiterated that he saw the U.S. economy as strong, as shown by recent economic indicators.   \par \par \uc2  The yen was trading around 106.90  to the dollar on Monday. It hit a three-year high of 106.74 on December 9.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040105e015000gx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
